      "timestamp_raw": "Jun 10, 2019 13:01:27 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Okay, this is looking more like a S. \"pretty dark widow\" but not quite black widow...yet!  We just had a heat wave that fried quite a few of the traps, so unfortunately, I'm not sure these will last long enough to get really black.  Maybe the next set of pitchers will be good looking.  <br/><br/>To recap, this clone really needs to have the traps age for quite a while before they blacken up.  Photos takne 6/10-ish/19:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48038426372_3070a713fa_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>S. 'Getting darker...widow':<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48038321891_6ea5ca8ec3_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48038426262_62dd034ab6_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48038321611_9e0bedd913_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48038321531_bc79f20e7a_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>r",
